# Thornplate Intimidator: "That player can always choose to lose 3 life, even if they have cards to discard or nonland permanents to
# sacrifice" (the rulings). On turn 3 Bot2 controls a Memnite and an Ornithopter and holds Islands, and chooses to lose 3 life: it keeps
# every permanent and card (17 life, nothing sacrificed or discarded).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Thornplate Intimidator
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x18

